# Overrides dashboard/.gitignore for packing purposes - that file's `dist/`
# rule is correct for git (build output shouldn't be committed) but wrong
# for npm packing (dist/ is exactly what needs to ship - see the note in
# the root .npmignore). node_modules never gets built anyway; kept here for
# clarity, not because npm would otherwise include it from this subfolder.
node_modules/
*.log
